Package: quantion
Type: Package
Title: Peak Detection and Quantification for Mass Spectrometry Data
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("J", "Osorio", email = "josoriom93@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Julien", "Wist", role = "cph"),
    person("Jorge", "Osorio M.", role = "cph"),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "ctb",
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS"))
Author: J Osorio [aut, cre, cph], Julien Wist [cph], Jorge Osorio M. [cph],
    Authors of the dependency Rust crates [ctb] (see inst/AUTHORS)
Maintainer: J Osorio <josoriom93@gmail.com>
Description: Reads 'mzML' and 'ion' mass spectrometry files, extracts ion
    chromatograms, finds and integrates chromatographic peaks, detects and
    aligns features across samples, and predicts retention times with an
    'ONNX' warp model. The computations run in a native library written in
    'Rust'.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: curl, utils
Suggests: parallel, testthat, callr
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.88)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
